<title>USA: Cambex, Jupiter Technology end merger.</title>
<headline>Cambex, Jupiter Technology end merger.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambex Corp and Jupiter Technology Inc said on Friday that they had mutually agreed to end the proposed acquisition of Jupiter by Cambex due to business and stock market conditions.</p>
<p>Cambex will continue to resell Jupiter's Frame Relay access products, they added.</p>
<p>Cambex Corp is a supplier of direct access storage products used with IBM mainframe and client/server computers.</p>
<p>Jupiter Technology is a privately held supplier of intelligent network access products.</p>
</text>
